\pard\b Terms & Conditions:\b0\par
\pard\fs19
1. \b Scope & Reporting:\b0  Single-point pickup & drop only (no standby). Vehicle will report 15 minutes prior to shift timing; 20 minutes grace at pickup/drop.\par
2. \b Vehicle Deployment:\b0  Multiple Maruti Ertiga AC (6+1 Seater) commercial vehicles and verified drivers may be deployed across shifts.\par
3. \b KM & Trip Log:\b0  Point-to-Point (Poonamallee to Irungattukottai) reckoned via signed daily trip sheets / GPS log. Unutilized trips/KMs do not carry forward.\par
4. \b Tolls & Parking:\b0  Highway FASTag tolls, parking charges, and state entry taxes (if any) billed extra at actuals against FASTag statement / receipts.\par
5. \b Fuel Escalation:\b0  Rates are linked to prevailing Chennai fuel prices. Any variation exceeding +/-5% will be adjusted proportionately.\par
6. \b Compliance & Backup:\b0  Commercial yellow-board vehicles with valid RC, insurance, PUC, FC, 80 km/h speed governor, GPS, and uniformed, police-verified (PVC) drivers. Breakdown replacement within 60 minutes.\par
7. \b GST & Payment:\b0  5% GST (2.5% CGST + 2.5% SGST) extra under SAC 9966 (GSTIN \b 33COVPM0531D1Z4\b0). Monthly invoice submitted with trip logs; payment within 15 / 30 days of receipt.\par
8. \b Notice & Jurisdiction:\b0  30 days' prior written notice for termination. Subject to Chennai jurisdiction. Quotation valid for 15 days.\par
